Limitations

Small sample sizes (~10–17 points per function).

Risk of overfitting surrogate models.

Computational constraints limited NN size and GP restarts.

Weekly submission delay restricts rapid exploration.

Neural networks may extrapolate poorly in sparse regions.

GP scalability decreases with dimensionality.

Failure Modes

Convergence to local optima.

Surrogate mis-specification (incorrect kernel assumptions).

Locking onto noisy spikes.

Exploration parameter misconfiguration.

